# Typst compiled output
# main.pdf is a build artifact (regenerated by new-project.sh, test.sh, or
# the Typst LSP preview) — never meant to be versioned.
# example.pdf is the intentionally committed reference render for each
# scaffold, so it is explicitly kept.
main.pdf
!example.pdf

